    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inviting",
     "texto": [
      "**Ayo ikut lomba** means \"Come on, take part in the contest!\". **Mari kita mendaftar** invites doing something together. In English the verb changes with the subject; these Indonesian formulas do not change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Notices about activities",
     "texto": [
      "In a notice, **acara mulai** says when the event begins and **pendaftaran berakhir** when it stops being possible to sign up."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
